+## Keys and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are listed in the
+data file as `apiKeys: [{ "key", "name", "role" }]`.
+
+- `viewer`: reads (GET).
+- `cook`: also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+No key or an unknown key is 401 `unauthorized`; a role without permission is
+403 `forbidden`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every request by a known key that is not a GET adds an entry
+`{ id, at, by, method, path, status }`. `GET /audit` lists them newest first
+(managers only).
